'''Silent Step''' is a Survive-tree perk in ''[[Human Host]]''. The in-game display name may differ from this page title; the authoritative identifier is the runtime factor field name.

== Effect ==

Reduces the sound radius of your footsteps.

== Technical ==

Backing runtime factor: <code>_silentStepReduce_Factor</code> (type <code>Single</code>) on <code>Char_Skills</code> in the <code>Creature</code> assembly.

